[1959.385832, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B- \u001b[1mBackend:\u001b[14G\u001b]8;id=yno1gn;https://demo.ddev.site/typo3/\u0007\u001b[22m\u001b[94mhttps://demo.ddev.site/typo3/\u001b[39m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mFrontend:\u001b[15G\u001b]8;id=datk3r;https://demo.ddev.site/\u0007\u001b[22m\u001b[94mhttps://demo.ddev.site/\u001b]8;;\u0007\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BI\u001b[5Gcan't\u001b[11Gconfirm\u001b[19Gthe\u001b[23Gtabs\u001b[28Gopened.\u001b[36GThe\u001b[40Gbrowser\u001b[48Gprinted\u001b[56G\"Broken\u001b[64Gpipe\"\u001b[70Gerrors\u001b[77Gwhen\u001b[82Git\u001b[85Gstarted.\u001b[94GThese\u001b[100Goften\u001b[106Gappear\u001b[113Gwhen\u001b[118GChromium\u001b[127Gis\u001b[130Gstarted\u001b[138Gfrom\u001b[143Ga\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gscript and don't always mean it failed. If nothing opened, paste the URLs into your browser yourself.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BLog\u001b[7Gin\u001b[10Gwith\u001b[15Gthe\u001b[19Gusername\u001b[28G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249madmin\u001b[39m.\u001b[35GThe\u001b[39Gpassword\u001b[48Gis\u001b[51Gin\r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;177;185;249m/tmp/claude-1000/-home-lina-wolf-projects-typo3-t3ca-2026-demo/35cca6d0-ad19-4ca1-9b7c-74f0f1c6ca26/scratchpad/admin-password.txt\u001b[39m.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GS\u001b[5Gutéed for\u001b[15G8s · done 7:31 AM\r\u001b[2B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mYour connection is not private\u001b[39m                                                                                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mRan \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mYour\u001b[8Gbrowser\u001b[16Gshows\u001b[22Gthat\u001b[27Gwarning\u001b[35Gbecause\u001b[43Git\u001b[46Gdoesn't\u001b[54Gtrust\u001b[60Gthe\u001b[64Gcertificate\u001b[76GDDEV\u001b[81Guses\u001b[86Gfor\u001b[90G\u001b]8;id=fg1t4;https://demo.ddev.site\u0007\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mhttps://demo.ddev.site\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[39m.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BDDEV sig\u001b[12Gs\u001b[14Gits certificat\u001b[29Gs w\u001b[34Gh \u001b[37G \u001b[39Gocal certif\u001b[51Gcate authority from \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmkcert\u001b[39m. That authority already exists\u001b[109Gon\u001b[112Gyour\u001b[117Gmachine,\u001b[126Gin\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m~/.local/share/mkcert\u001b[39m,\u001b[26Gbut\u001b[30Git\u001b[33Gisn't\u001b[39Gin\u001b[42GChrome's\u001b[51Glist\u001b[56Gof\u001b[59Gtrusted\u001b[67Gcertificate\u001b[79Gauthorities.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BTo fix it, run this in the prompt:\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B \u001b[3G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m! mkcert -install\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2B  It adds the authority to your system and browser trust stores and will probably ask for your sudo password. I haven't run it myself because it\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bchanges\u001b[11Gyour\u001b[16Gmachine's\u001b[26Gtrust\u001b[32Gsettings.\u001b[42GAfter\u001b[48Git\u001b[51Gfinishes,\u001b[61Gfully\u001b[67Gclose\u001b[73Gthe\u001b[77Gbrowser\u001b[85G(every\u001b[92Gwindow)\u001b[100Gand\u001b[104Greopen\u001b[111G\u001b]8;id=yno1gn;https://demo.ddev.site/typo3/\u0007\u001b[94mhttps://demo.ddev.site/typo3/\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[39m.\u001b[142GThe\r\u001b[1B \u001b[3Gwarning should be gone.\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1BIf\u001b[6Gyou don't want\u001b[21Gto\u001b[24Gchange\u001b[31Gthe\u001b[35Gtrust\u001b[41Gsettings,\u001b[51Gyou\u001b[55Gcan\u001b[59Gclick\u001b[65G\u001b[1mAdvanced → Proceed to demo.ddev.site\u001b[102G\u001b[22mfor\u001b[106Gnow.\u001b[111GThat\u001b[116Gonly\u001b[121Gaffects\u001b[129Gthis\u001b[134Glocal\u001b[140Gsite.\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCogitated for 9s ·\u001b[22Gdone 7:32 AM\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[3B❯ \r\u001b[38C\u001b[2B\u001b[K\